Description: Translate ParaView’s 3D options in the edition’s nine locale catalogues
 Preserve the shared KiCad and Jmol labels and carry the eight additional notices
 in every locale. English remains in the program.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-21
---
diff --git a/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/de.po b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/de.po
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/de.po
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# ParaView in Sparky Stereo OS: the sentences of its 3D options.
+# This file is distributed under the same license as ParaView (BSD-3-Clause).
+msgid ""
+msgstr ""
+"Project-Id-Version: paraview-stereo 6.1.1\n"
+"Language: de\n"
+"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
+"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
+"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
+
+msgid "3D display settings..."
+msgstr "3D-Anzeigeeinstellungen ..."
+
+msgid "Enable 3D"
+msgstr "3D einschalten"
+
+msgid "The display settings could not be opened."
+msgstr "Die Anzeigeeinstellungen konnten nicht geöffnet werden."
+
+msgid "Show the render views in 3D: ParaView hands each view to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "Renderansichten in 3D anzeigen, indem ParaView jede Ansicht als Stereopaar an den Desktop übergibt und der Desktop das Format jedes Bildschirms gemäß den 3D-Anzeigeeinstellungen im Menü „View“ erzeugt."
+
+msgid "Specify the stereo type to use. The only stereo type is 'Crystal Eyes': ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings."
+msgstr "Wählen Sie mit dieser Option den Stereotyp, wobei nur 'Crystal Eyes' verfügbar ist und ParaView seine 3D-Ansichten als Stereopaare an den Desktop übergibt, der das Format für jeden Bildschirm gemäß den 3D-Anzeigeeinstellungen erzeugt."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The stereo type \"%1\" is not offered: ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings. Start ParaView with --stereo, or with no option: 3D is on unless you turn it off."
+msgstr "Der Stereotyp „%1“ ist nicht verfügbar, weil ParaView seine 3D-Ansichten als Stereopaare an den Desktop übergibt und der Desktop die Formate für die einzelnen Bildschirme gemäß den 3D-Anzeigeeinstellungen erzeugt, darunter Rot-Blau-Anaglyphe, Zeilen- und Spaltenformate und Schachbrett, daher starten Sie ParaView mit --stereo oder ohne Option (3D bleibt eingeschaltet, solange Sie es nicht ausschalten)."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself: the view is shown as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "Eine gespeicherte Einstellung oder Zustandsdatei fordert den Stereotyp „%1“ an, den ParaView nicht mehr selbst erzeugt, sodass die Ansicht als Stereopaar angezeigt wird und der Desktop die Formate für die einzelnen Bildschirme gemäß den 3D-Anzeigeeinstellungen im Menü „View“ erzeugt, darunter Rot-Blau-Anaglyphe, Zeilen- und Spaltenformate und Schachbrett."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself; the view is shown flat because Enable 3D is off (View menu)."
+msgstr "Eine gespeicherte Einstellung oder Zustandsdatei fordert den Stereotyp „%1“ an, den ParaView nicht mehr selbst erzeugt, und die Ansicht wird flach angezeigt, weil „3D einschalten“ im Menü „View“ deaktiviert ist."
+
+msgid "These 3D views are shown flat: this desktop does not show 3D areas inside windows."
+msgstr "Diese 3D-Ansichten werden flach angezeigt, weil dieser Desktop keine 3D-Bereiche in Fenstern anzeigt."
+
+msgid "This takes effect when ParaView starts again."
+msgstr "Die Änderung wird beim nächsten Start von ParaView wirksam."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The screenshot's stereo mode \"%1\" is not offered: the picture is saved as the view shows it."
+msgstr "Da der Stereomodus „%1“ für Bildschirmfotos nicht verfügbar ist, wird das Bild so gespeichert, wie es in der Ansicht angezeigt wird."
diff --git a/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/es.po b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/es.po
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/es.po
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# ParaView in Sparky Stereo OS: the sentences of its 3D options.
+# This file is distributed under the same license as ParaView (BSD-3-Clause).
+msgid ""
+msgstr ""
+"Project-Id-Version: paraview-stereo 6.1.1\n"
+"Language: es\n"
+"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
+"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
+"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
+
+msgid "3D display settings..."
+msgstr "Ajustes de la pantalla 3D..."
+
+msgid "Enable 3D"
+msgstr "Activar 3D"
+
+msgid "The display settings could not be opened."
+msgstr "No se pudieron abrir los Ajustes de pantalla."
+
+msgid "Show the render views in 3D: ParaView hands each view to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "Muestra las vistas de renderizado en 3D al entregar cada vista de ParaView al escritorio como un par estéreo para que el escritorio genere el formato de cada pantalla según los «Ajustes de la pantalla 3D» del menú «View»."
+
+msgid "Specify the stereo type to use. The only stereo type is 'Crystal Eyes': ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings."
+msgstr "Seleccione el tipo de estéreo, teniendo en cuenta que solo se ofrece 'Crystal Eyes' y que ParaView entrega sus vistas 3D al escritorio como pares estéreo para que este genere el formato de cada pantalla según los «Ajustes de la pantalla 3D»."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The stereo type \"%1\" is not offered: ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings. Start ParaView with --stereo, or with no option: 3D is on unless you turn it off."
+msgstr "El tipo de estéreo «%1» no está disponible, ya que ParaView entrega sus vistas 3D al escritorio como pares estéreo y el escritorio genera el formato de cada pantalla según los «Ajustes de la pantalla 3D», con opciones como anaglifo rojo y azul, entrelazado por filas o columnas y tablero de ajedrez, por lo que debe iniciar ParaView con --stereo o sin ninguna opción (el 3D sigue activado mientras no lo desactive)."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself: the view is shown as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "Una configuración guardada o un archivo de estado solicitó el tipo de estéreo «%1», que ParaView ya no genera por sí solo, así que la vista se muestra como un par estéreo y el escritorio genera el formato de cada pantalla según los «Ajustes de la pantalla 3D» del menú «View», con opciones como anaglifo rojo y azul, entrelazado por filas o columnas y tablero de ajedrez."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself; the view is shown flat because Enable 3D is off (View menu)."
+msgstr "Una configuración guardada o un archivo de estado solicitó el tipo de estéreo «%1», que ParaView ya no genera por sí solo, y la vista se muestra en plano porque «Activar 3D» está desactivado en el menú «View»."
+
+msgid "These 3D views are shown flat: this desktop does not show 3D areas inside windows."
+msgstr "Estas vistas 3D se muestran en plano porque este escritorio no muestra áreas 3D dentro de las ventanas."
+
+msgid "This takes effect when ParaView starts again."
+msgstr "El cambio se aplica la próxima vez que se inicie ParaView."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The screenshot's stereo mode \"%1\" is not offered: the picture is saved as the view shows it."
+msgstr "El modo estéreo «%1» no está disponible para las capturas de pantalla, así que la imagen se guarda tal como se ve en la vista."
diff --git a/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/fr.po b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/fr.po
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/fr.po
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# ParaView in Sparky Stereo OS: the sentences of its 3D options.
+# This file is distributed under the same license as ParaView (BSD-3-Clause).
+msgid ""
+msgstr ""
+"Project-Id-Version: paraview-stereo 6.1.1\n"
+"Language: fr\n"
+"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
+"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
+"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
+
+msgid "3D display settings..."
+msgstr "Réglages de l'écran 3D..."
+
+msgid "Enable 3D"
+msgstr "Activer la 3D"
+
+msgid "The display settings could not be opened."
+msgstr "Impossible d'ouvrir les Réglages de l'écran."
+
+msgid "Show the render views in 3D: ParaView hands each view to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "Affiche les vues de rendu en 3D en transmettant chaque vue de ParaView au bureau sous forme de paire stéréo, afin que le bureau produise le format de chaque écran selon les « Réglages de l'écran 3D » du menu « View »."
+
+msgid "Specify the stereo type to use. The only stereo type is 'Crystal Eyes': ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings."
+msgstr "Sélectionnez le type de stéréo, sachant que seul 'Crystal Eyes' est proposé et que ParaView transmet ses vues 3D au bureau sous forme de paires stéréo pour que celui-ci produise le format de chaque écran selon les « Réglages de l'écran 3D »."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The stereo type \"%1\" is not offered: ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings. Start ParaView with --stereo, or with no option: 3D is on unless you turn it off."
+msgstr "Le type de stéréo « %1 » est indisponible puisque ParaView transmet ses vues 3D au bureau sous forme de paires stéréo et que le bureau produit le format de chaque écran selon les « Réglages de l'écran 3D », notamment en anaglyphe rouge et bleu, en rangées ou colonnes entrelacées ou en damier, de sorte que vous devez démarrer ParaView avec --stereo ou sans option (la 3D reste active tant que vous ne la désactivez pas)."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself: the view is shown as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "Un réglage enregistré ou un fichier d’état a demandé le type de stéréo « %1 », que ParaView ne produit plus lui-même, si bien que la vue s’affiche sous forme de paire stéréo et que le bureau produit le format de chaque écran selon les « Réglages de l'écran 3D » du menu « View », notamment en anaglyphe rouge et bleu, en rangées ou colonnes entrelacées ou en damier."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself; the view is shown flat because Enable 3D is off (View menu)."
+msgstr "Un réglage enregistré ou un fichier d’état a demandé le type de stéréo « %1 », que ParaView ne produit plus lui-même, et la vue s’affiche à plat parce que l’option « Activer la 3D » est désactivée dans le menu « View »."
+
+msgid "These 3D views are shown flat: this desktop does not show 3D areas inside windows."
+msgstr "Ces vues 3D s’affichent à plat, car ce bureau ne permet pas d’afficher de zones 3D dans les fenêtres."
+
+msgid "This takes effect when ParaView starts again."
+msgstr "La modification prendra effet au prochain démarrage de ParaView."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The screenshot's stereo mode \"%1\" is not offered: the picture is saved as the view shows it."
+msgstr "Le mode stéréo « %1 » est indisponible pour les captures d’écran, donc l’image est enregistrée telle qu’elle s’affiche dans la vue."
diff --git a/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/ja.po b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/ja.po
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/ja.po
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# ParaView in Sparky Stereo OS: the sentences of its 3D options.
+# This file is distributed under the same license as ParaView (BSD-3-Clause).
+msgid ""
+msgstr ""
+"Project-Id-Version: paraview-stereo 6.1.1\n"
+"Language: ja\n"
+"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
+"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
+"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
+
+msgid "3D display settings..."
+msgstr "3D ディスプレイの設定..."
+
+msgid "Enable 3D"
+msgstr "3D を有効にする"
+
+msgid "The display settings could not be opened."
+msgstr "ディスプレイ設定を開けませんでした。"
+
+msgid "Show the render views in 3D: ParaView hands each view to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "ParaView が各レンダービューをステレオペアとしてデスクトップに渡し、デスクトップが「View」メニューの「3D ディスプレイの設定」に従って各画面の形式を生成することで、レンダービューを 3D で表示します。"
+
+msgid "Specify the stereo type to use. The only stereo type is 'Crystal Eyes': ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings."
+msgstr "使用するステレオ方式を指定し、選べる方式は 'Crystal Eyes' のみで、ParaView は 3D ビューをステレオペアとしてデスクトップに渡し、デスクトップが「3D ディスプレイの設定」に従って各画面の形式を生成します。"
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The stereo type \"%1\" is not offered: ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings. Start ParaView with --stereo, or with no option: 3D is on unless you turn it off."
+msgstr "ParaView は 3D ビューをステレオペアとしてデスクトップに渡し、デスクトップが「3D ディスプレイの設定」に従って画面ごとに赤青アナグリフ、行や列のインターレース、市松模様などの形式を生成するため、ステレオ方式「%1」は使用できず、ParaView は --stereo を指定するかオプションなしで起動してください（3D は無効にするまで有効です）。"
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself: the view is shown as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "保存済みの設定または状態ファイルが要求したステレオ方式「%1」は ParaView が直接生成しなくなったため、ビューはステレオペアとして表示され、デスクトップが「View」メニューの「3D ディスプレイの設定」に従って画面ごとに赤青アナグリフ、行や列のインターレース、市松模様などの形式を生成します。"
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself; the view is shown flat because Enable 3D is off (View menu)."
+msgstr "保存済みの設定または状態ファイルが要求したステレオ方式「%1」は ParaView が直接生成されなくなり、「View」メニューの「3D を有効にする」がオフなのでビューが平面表示になります。"
+
+msgid "These 3D views are shown flat: this desktop does not show 3D areas inside windows."
+msgstr "このデスクトップはウィンドウ内の 3D 領域を表示できないため、これらの 3D ビューは平面表示になります。"
+
+msgid "This takes effect when ParaView starts again."
+msgstr "この変更は、ParaView を次回起動すると反映されます。"
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The screenshot's stereo mode \"%1\" is not offered: the picture is saved as the view shows it."
+msgstr "スクリーンショットのステレオモード「%1」は使用できないため、画像はビューに表示されているとおりに保存されます。"
diff --git a/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/ko.po b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/ko.po
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/ko.po
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# ParaView in Sparky Stereo OS: the sentences of its 3D options.
+# This file is distributed under the same license as ParaView (BSD-3-Clause).
+msgid ""
+msgstr ""
+"Project-Id-Version: paraview-stereo 6.1.1\n"
+"Language: ko\n"
+"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
+"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
+"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
+
+msgid "3D display settings..."
+msgstr "3D 디스플레이 설정..."
+
+msgid "Enable 3D"
+msgstr "3D 켜기"
+
+msgid "The display settings could not be opened."
+msgstr "디스플레이 설정을 열 수 없습니다."
+
+msgid "Show the render views in 3D: ParaView hands each view to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "ParaView가 각 렌더링 뷰를 스테레오 쌍으로 데스크톱에 전달하고 데스크톱이 ‘View’ 메뉴의 ‘3D 디스플레이 설정’에 따라 화면별 형식을 생성하여 렌더링 뷰를 3D로 표시합니다."
+
+msgid "Specify the stereo type to use. The only stereo type is 'Crystal Eyes': ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings."
+msgstr "사용할 스테레오 방식을 지정하며, 선택할 수 있는 방식은 'Crystal Eyes'뿐이고 ParaView가 3D 뷰를 스테레오 쌍으로 데스크톱에 전달하면 데스크톱이 ‘3D 디스플레이 설정’에 따라 화면별 형식을 생성합니다."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The stereo type \"%1\" is not offered: ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings. Start ParaView with --stereo, or with no option: 3D is on unless you turn it off."
+msgstr "ParaView는 3D 뷰를 스테레오 쌍으로 데스크톱에 전달하고 데스크톱은 ‘3D 디스플레이 설정’에 따라 적청 애너글리프, 행 또는 열 인터레이스, 체커보드 등 화면별 형식을 생성하므로 ‘%1’ 스테레오 방식은 사용할 수 없어 --stereo를 지정하거나 옵션 없이 ParaView를 시작하십시오(3D는 직접 끄기 전까지 켜져 있습니다)."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself: the view is shown as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "저장된 설정 또는 상태 파일에서 요청한 ‘%1’ 스테레오 방식은 ParaView가 더 이상 직접 생성하지 않으므로 뷰를 스테레오 쌍으로 표시하고 데스크톱은 ‘View’ 메뉴의 ‘3D 디스플레이 설정’에 따라 적청 애너글리프, 행 또는 열 인터레이스, 체커보드 등 화면별 형식을 생성합니다."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself; the view is shown flat because Enable 3D is off (View menu)."
+msgstr "저장된 설정 또는 상태 파일에서 요청한 ‘%1’ 스테레오 방식은 ParaView가 더 이상 직접 생성하지 않으며, ‘View’ 메뉴의 ‘3D 켜기’가 꺼져 있어 뷰를 평면으로 표시합니다."
+
+msgid "These 3D views are shown flat: this desktop does not show 3D areas inside windows."
+msgstr "이 데스크톱은 창 안에 3D 영역을 표시하지 못하므로 이 3D 뷰는 평면으로 표시됩니다."
+
+msgid "This takes effect when ParaView starts again."
+msgstr "이 변경 사항은 ParaView를 다시 시작할 때 적용됩니다."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The screenshot's stereo mode \"%1\" is not offered: the picture is saved as the view shows it."
+msgstr "스크린샷의 ‘%1’ 스테레오 모드는 사용할 수 없으므로 뷰에 표시된 그대로 이미지를 저장합니다."
diff --git a/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/pl.po b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/pl.po
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/pl.po
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# ParaView in Sparky Stereo OS: the sentences of its 3D options.
+# This file is distributed under the same license as ParaView (BSD-3-Clause).
+msgid ""
+msgstr ""
+"Project-Id-Version: paraview-stereo 6.1.1\n"
+"Language: pl\n"
+"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
+"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
+"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
+
+msgid "3D display settings..."
+msgstr "Ustawienia wyświetlacza 3D..."
+
+msgid "Enable 3D"
+msgstr "Włącz 3D"
+
+msgid "The display settings could not be opened."
+msgstr "Nie udało się otworzyć ustawień wyświetlacza."
+
+msgid "Show the render views in 3D: ParaView hands each view to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "Wyświetla widoki renderowania w 3D, przekazując każdy widok ParaView na pulpit jako parę stereo, z której pulpit tworzy format każdego ekranu według ustawień na stronie „Ustawienia wyświetlacza 3D” w menu „View”."
+
+msgid "Specify the stereo type to use. The only stereo type is 'Crystal Eyes': ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format in its 3D display settings."
+msgstr "Wybierz typ stereo, pamiętając, że dostępny jest tylko 'Crystal Eyes' i że ParaView przekazuje widoki 3D na pulpit jako pary stereo, z których pulpit tworzy format odpowiedni dla każdego ekranu według ustawień na stronie „Ustawienia wyświetlacza 3D”."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The stereo type \"%1\" is not offered: ParaView hands its 3D views to the desktop as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings. Start ParaView with --stereo, or with no option: 3D is on unless you turn it off."
+msgstr "Typ stereo „%1” jest niedostępny, ponieważ ParaView przekazuje widoki 3D na pulpit jako pary stereo, z których pulpit tworzy format odpowiedni dla każdego ekranu według ustawień na stronie „Ustawienia wyświetlacza 3D”, w tym anaglif czerwono-niebieski, przeplot wierszy lub kolumn i szachownicę, więc uruchom ParaView z --stereo albo bez opcji (3D pozostaje włączone, dopóki go nie wyłączysz)."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself: the view is shown as a stereo pair, and the desktop makes each screen's format, red-blue, interlaced and checkerboard among them, in its 3D display settings (View menu)."
+msgstr "Zapisane ustawienie lub plik stanu wskazuje typ stereo „%1”, którego ParaView już samodzielnie nie tworzy, więc widok jest wyświetlany jako para stereo, a pulpit tworzy format odpowiedni dla każdego ekranu według ustawień na stronie „Ustawienia wyświetlacza 3D” w menu „View”, w tym anaglif czerwono-niebieski, przeplot wierszy lub kolumn i szachownicę."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "A saved setting or state file asked for \"%1\" stereo, which ParaView no longer makes itself; the view is shown flat because Enable 3D is off (View menu)."
+msgstr "Zapisane ustawienie lub plik stanu wskazuje typ stereo „%1”, którego ParaView już samodzielnie nie tworzy, a widok jest wyświetlany płasko, ponieważ opcja „Włącz 3D” w menu „View” jest wyłączona."
+
+msgid "These 3D views are shown flat: this desktop does not show 3D areas inside windows."
+msgstr "Te widoki 3D są wyświetlane płasko, ponieważ ten pulpit nie wyświetla obszarów 3D wewnątrz okien."
+
+msgid "This takes effect when ParaView starts again."
+msgstr "Zmiana zacznie działać przy następnym uruchomieniu ParaView."
+
+#, qt-format
+msgid "The screenshot's stereo mode \"%1\" is not offered: the picture is saved as the view shows it."
+msgstr "Tryb stereo „%1” jest niedostępny dla zrzutów ekranu, więc obraz jest zapisywany tak, jak jest wyświetlany w widoku."
diff --git a/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/pt_BR.po b/Clients/ParaView/stereo-po/pt_BR.po
